This is one of the bad things about NetHack.  Watch a complete newbie play,
and you'll see they hate it because:

	1. Doors "resist" most of the time.
		Newbie says, "Hmm... a magic door!"

	2. Doors/chests are often locked.
		Newbie says, "Hmm... gotta find a key!"

	3. Secret doors are common.
		Newbies says, "Hmm... deadend."


Now, without knowing to KICK and SEARCH, the game is almost unplayable.
These things should be TOLD to a newbie.  First line of the help file
should point these things out (or better still, verboseverbose mode
should output "the door resists (try kicking)", etc.

This would help to make NetHack more popular.


... so would a graphical version...  *wink* *wink*

